@Shopera_HostAddress = http://localhost:5208
@SellerUserId = 3
@ProductId = 1
@ImageId = 1

### Create a test JPEG image upload (multipart/form-data)
### Note: This example uses a placeholder. In real testing, use a valid JPEG file
POST {{Shopera_HostAddress}}/api/seller/products/{{ProductId}}/images
X-Seller-User-Id: {{SellerUserId}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="File"; filename="test-image.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

<file:../TestAssets/sample-image.jpg>
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="AltText"

Front view of product
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="DisplayOrder"

1
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="IsPrimary"

true
------WebKitFormBoundary--

### Upload a PNG image
POST {{Shopera_HostAddress}}/api/seller/products/{{ProductId}}/images
X-Seller-User-Id: {{SellerUserId}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="File"; filename="test-image.png"
Content-Type: image/png

<file:../TestAssets/sample-image.png>
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="AltText"

Side view of product
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="DisplayOrder"

2
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="IsPrimary"

false
------WebKitFormBoundary--

### Update image metadata (alt text and display order)
PATCH {{Shopera_HostAddress}}/api/seller/products/{{ProductId}}/images/{{ImageId}}
X-Seller-User-Id: {{SellerUserId}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="AltText"

Updated: Back view of product
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="DisplayOrder"

3
------WebKitFormBoundary--

### Replace an image with new file while updating metadata
PATCH {{Shopera_HostAddress}}/api/seller/products/{{ProductId}}/images/{{ImageId}}
X-Seller-User-Id: {{SellerUserId}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="File"; filename="new-image.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

<file:../TestAssets/replacement-image.jpg>
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="AltText"

Replacement front view
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="IsPrimary"

true
------WebKitFormBoundary--

### Make an image primary (promote it)
PATCH {{Shopera_HostAddress}}/api/seller/products/{{ProductId}}/images/{{ImageId}}
X-Seller-User-Id: {{SellerUserId}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="IsPrimary"

true
------WebKitFormBoundary--

### Seller preview of Draft product image
GET {{Shopera_HostAddress}}/api/seller/products/{{ProductId}}/images/{{ImageId}}/content
X-Seller-User-Id: {{SellerUserId}}

### Public image content endpoint (for public/active products only)
GET {{Shopera_HostAddress}}/api/product-images/{{ImageId}}/content

### Delete an image
DELETE {{Shopera_HostAddress}}/api/seller/products/{{ProductId}}/images/{{ImageId}}
X-Seller-User-Id: {{SellerUserId}}

### Attempt to upload without a file (should fail)
POST {{Shopera_HostAddress}}/api/seller/products/{{ProductId}}/images
X-Seller-User-Id: {{SellerUserId}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="AltText"

This should fail - no file
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="DisplayOrder"

1
------WebKitFormBoundary--

### Attempt to upload invalid format (should fail - not an image)
POST {{Shopera_HostAddress}}/api/seller/products/{{ProductId}}/images
X-Seller-User-Id: {{SellerUserId}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="File"; filename="document.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

%PDF-1.4 fake PDF content
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="DisplayOrder"

1
------WebKitFormBoundary--

### Attempt to upload image for someone else's product (should fail - unauthorized)
POST {{Shopera_HostAddress}}/api/seller/products/999/images
X-Seller-User-Id: {{SellerUserId}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="File"; filename="hacked.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

<file:../TestAssets/sample-image.jpg>
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="DisplayOrder"

1
------WebKitFormBoundary--

### Attempt to create duplicate DisplayOrder (should fail with conflict error)
POST {{Shopera_HostAddress}}/api/seller/products/{{ProductId}}/images
X-Seller-User-Id: {{SellerUserId}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="File"; filename="duplicate-order.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

<file:../TestAssets/sample-image.jpg>
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="DisplayOrder"

1
------WebKitFormBoundary--
